## Diagram Description

This C4 Context diagram shows ReSys.Shop at the highest level of abstraction. The system sits between customers and administrators on one side, and external payment, notification, storage, and identity services on the other. The key architectural decision visible here is the **modular monolith** — one system boundary handles all 8 business domains internally.

**Evidence**: `infra/Aspire/src/ReSys.AppHost/AppHost.cs:1-49`, `README.md:17-44`
